```gitignore
# Python virtual environment
.venv/
venv/
*/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# IDE/Editor specific files
.idea/
.vscode/

# OS specific files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Output files (optional - decide if you want to commit the model)
# *.joblib

# Large data files (optional - consider Git LFS if needed)
# data/*.csv
```